# This repo targets Linux containers (Docker) from a Windows dev machine with
# core.autocrlf=true. Without this file, git silently converts these files to
# CRLF on checkout -- which breaks `git apply` against a freshly-cloned LF
# source tree (fineract.patch) and breaks the shebang line on scripts executed
# directly inside a container (Postgres's docker-entrypoint-initdb.d scripts).
# Force LF regardless of any individual clone's autocrlf setting.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.patch text eol=lf
*.diff text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf
